==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þekkja|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈθɛhca/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɛhca|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|þekkti|þekkt}}

# {{transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[know]], to be [[familiar]] with{{jump|is|be familiar with|s}}
#: ''Ég '''þekki''' þennan mann ekki!''
#:: I don't '''know''' this person!
# {{transitive|governs the accusative}} to [[recognize]], to [[know]]{{jump|is|recognize|s}}
#: ''Geir? Ég '''þekkti''' þig ekki.''
#:: Geir? I didn't '''recognize''' you.

